[00:20.44]Life in this world can be hard.
[00:25.98]Life in this world can bring tears and pain.
[00:31.92]Still ev’ry day I will say,
[00:37.04]“My life is not in vain.”
[00:42.97](Chorus)
[00:43.12]For God is not unrighteous,
[00:48.28]And he remembers the love I’ve shown.
[00:54.62]So he is ever near me;
[01:00.36]With Jehovah, I’m not alone.
[01:05.82]Yes, God is my provider
[01:11.36]and my protector down to the end.
[01:18.28]Yes, Jehovah is my Father,
[01:23.88]My God and Friend.
[01:31.98]Gone are the days of my youth;
[01:55.30]Days of calamity now are here.
[02:02.37]Still through the eyes of my faith,
[02:07.68]My hope is bright and clear.
[02:13.41](Chorus)
[02:13.56]For God is not unrighteous,
[02:18.88]And he remembers the love I’ve shown.
[02:24.64]So he is ever near me;
[02:29.72]With Jehovah, I’m not alone.
[02:35.80]Yes, God is my provider
[02:41.32]and my protector down to the end.
[02:48.26]Yes, Jehovah is my Father,
[02:54.72]My God and Friend.
